# Local-only (not committed): top-level scripts, run outputs.
# Anchored with a leading slash so `iac/scripts/` (and other nested scripts/
# directories) are NOT ignored. Without the anchor, gitignore matches
# `scripts/` at any depth and silently drops `iac/scripts/` from commits.
/scripts/
/exports/

